OL,3,GNEWSA'Rare' council underspend to help
OL,4,Awith cost of living
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham City Council is to provide
OL,7,Fmore support with the cost of living
OL,8,Fafter spending millions of pounds less
OL,9,Fthan expected, the authority's deputy
OL,10,Fleader has said.
OL,12,FIt was announced earlier this summer
OL,13,Fthat the Labour-run council had
OL,14,Funderspent by more than #20m in the
OL,15,F2025-26 financial year.
OL,17,FEthan Radford said details were still
OL,18,Fbeing finalised but the council would
OL,19,Fshortly announce a series of one-off
OL,20,Fmeasures "designed to alleviate
OL,21,Fpressure on individuals and
OL,22,Fbusinesses."
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
